  "text": "Profane Scabarites\n​\nIntroduction\nProfane Scabarites  are slayer monsters requiring 87  to kill. They can be killed off-task, or with either a \"Scabarites\" or \"Profane Scabarites\" task for on-task bonuses.\n​\nStats\n⬥  level required: 87\n⬥  XP per kill: 900\n⬥ Optimal kills per hour: ~850 \n⬥ Optimal  XP per hour: ~765k \n​\nDesirable drops\n⬥ The Spectral Lens  which is the Necromancy slayer helm component.\n​\nUseful Items and Unlocks\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nItems\n⬥ Powder of penance \n    • Helps sustain your prayer.\n⬥ Elder overload \n⬥ Weapon poison+++ \n⬥ Cinderbane gloves \n⬥ Scripture of Amascut \n    • Can be substituted for any of the GWD3 books\nOther\n⬥ Restocking Cannon Ability \n    • Allows  restocking without user input.\n⬥ Animate Dead \n    • Only needed if using  /  instead of the recommended gear\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n​\nLocation and How to Get there\n⬥ Profane Scabarites are only found in the Scabarite Cavern outside of Pollnivneach.\n​\nGetting to: Profane Scabarites\n⬥ Once inside the cavern, cross the bridge to south-western area.\n‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• Follow the image below to place and load your cannon.\n‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• Stand 2 tiles south-west of your cannon.\n\n​\nMethod: AFK Magic \n​\n⬥ Set an Alt1 alarm for 50% HP in case of bad RNG, and active  when it does.\n⬥ Pray  /  and \n⬥ Autocast  or \n​\nPresets and Relics\n⬥ Magic preset \n\nAbility Bar\n\n​\nExample Kills\n⬥ AFK Magic Profane Scabarites \n​\n\n      \n    ",
  "normalizedText": "Profane Scabarites ​ Introduction Profane Scabarites are slayer monsters requiring 87 to kill. They can be killed off-task, or with either a \"Scabarites\" or \"Profane Scabarites\" task for on-task bonuses. ​ Stats ⬥ level required: 87 ⬥ XP per kill: 900 ⬥ Optimal kills per hour: ~850 ⬥ Optimal XP per hour: ~765k ​ Desirable drops ⬥ The Spectral Lens which is the Necromancy slayer helm component. ​ Useful Items and Unlocks Items ⬥ Powder of penance • Helps sustain your prayer. ⬥ Elder overload ⬥ Weapon poison+++ ⬥ Cinderbane gloves ⬥ Scripture of Amascut • Can be substituted for any of the GWD3 books Other ⬥ Restocking Cannon Ability • Allows restocking without user input. ⬥ Animate Dead • Only needed if using / instead of the recommended gear ​ Location and How to Get there ⬥ Profane Scabarites are only found in the Scabarite Cavern outside of Pollnivneach. ​ Getting to: Profane Scabarites ⬥ Once inside the cavern, cross the bridge to south-western area. ‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• Follow the image below to place and load your cannon. ‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• Stand 2 tiles south-west of your cannon. ​ Method: AFK Magic ​ ⬥ Set an Alt1 alarm for 50% HP in case of bad RNG, and active when it does. ⬥ Pray / and ⬥ Autocast or ​ Presets and Relics ⬥ Magic preset Ability Bar ​ Example Kills ⬥ AFK Magic Profane Scabarites ​",
